### Callback
```javascript
gateway.transaction.releaseFromEscrow("transaction_id", function(err, result) {
});
```

### Promise
```javascript
gateway.transaction.releaseFromEscrow("transaction_id")
    .then(result => {
    });
```
If the transaction can't be found, it will return a[notFoundError](/braintree/docs/reference/general/exceptions/node#not-found-error).
